    <INVARIANT REVIEW="engine lead">Instance checks report every differing paternal clan display without a saved surname decision as an actionable, nonblocking invitation to name the clan form.</INVARIANT>
    <INVARIANT REVIEW="engine lead">New instances pin an exact engine release; checks and desk builds explain drift, and a separate work record binds the installed wheel to a declared source commit.</INVARIANT>
    <INTENT>One family root from which every path is read; the engine is installed, the instance is opened.</INTENT>
    <PRD_REF>docs/PRD.md#ARCH</PRD_REF>
    <PRD_REF>docs/PRD.md#INSTANCE</PRD_REF>
    <PRD_REF>docs/PRD.md#FORMS</PRD_REF>
    <INVARIANT REVIEW="engine lead">Malformed documents, chapters and evidence containers name the file, expected container and complete example while selected validation retains all findings.</INVARIANT>
