    <REL TYPE="IMPLEMENTED_BY" TARGET="MOD-FAMILY-WRITER"/>
    <REL TYPE="IMPLEMENTED_BY" TARGET="MOD-DISPLAY-INPUTS"/>
    <INVARIANT REVIEW="engine lead">Absent optional source details remain null without discarding records. Collector records and journals stay outside output snapshots and watches until adopted by explicit references from authored state, including cases and versions. Working findings are grouped separately; own-path checks and adopted dependencies remain strict.</INVARIANT>
    <INVARIANT REVIEW="engine lead">Own-path or prefix checks list their full selected file set and findings without implying a family or publication verdict.</INVARIANT>
    <INVARIANT REVIEW="engine lead">Snapshots live beside the family, link archive and feed asset bytes without staged writes reaching originals, treat missing/invalid-name dependencies consistently in their watch, report large input sizes, and reap only marked directories older than a day whose owning process is gone.</INVARIANT>
  </FEATURE_INSTANCE>

  <MODULE_INSTANCE_VALIDATION ID="MOD-INSTANCE-VALIDATION" FILE="src/familiar/instance/validation.py" STATE="IMPLEMENTED">
    <INVARIANT REVIEW="engine lead">Rejected tree contributions are blocking data findings with file, claim and cause, including selected-file checks.</INVARIANT>
    <REL TYPE="DEPENDS_ON" TARGET="MOD-TREE-BUILDER"/>
    <INVARIANT REVIEW="engine lead">A saved controlled zero may support a weak against argument only within its recorded read scope; positive arguments still require findings, and refusals or dubious queries supply no negative evidence.</INVARIANT>
