  <MODULE_DISPLAY_INPUTS ID="MOD-DISPLAY-INPUTS" FILE="src/familiar/instance/display.py" STATE="IMPLEMENTED">
    <!-- Shared adoption closure selects records and referenced search files recursively for validation, life assessment and every output dependency watch. Unknown journal numeric metadata is allowed; stored finite probabilities, source references and adoption closure remain core data guarantees. -->
    <!-- Writer-owned build-local reference indexes bind input metadata. Each
         check resolves shared directories once and rechecks final reparse points. -->
    <!-- Desk input digests reuse writer-verified hashes only while file identity,
         size and timestamps match. Explicit reader verify retains full byte checks. -->
    <!-- Display selection shares document delivery's host-mapped originals boundary; record file inputs are typed top-level saved index results. A referenced research original the reader only tests for existence binds by name, size and time, not bytes (pilot: 3.1 GiB snapshot became 0.26 GiB). -->
  </MODULE_DISPLAY_INPUTS>
